                                "sense_id": "b28d99c7-8650-3e04-9c2c-ae15ee1ccd53",
                                "text": "Health Food stores began displaying posters saying things like: “The American Indian, You Know, Walked!” It became a common sight to see longhairs and their chicks striding along purposefully eating maize-on-the-cob."
